# Pairs with NoStaleAuthority. Defect #4806: the ledger filtered leases on the
# recorded deadline alone, so a lease past its deadline on the grain's clock but
# still trusted by a slower silo was neither pushed to nor waited out. The base
# captures every lease whose deadline plus the clock-rate margin has not passed.
MODULE: StartAdvanceDropsMarginLease
TARGET: NoStaleAuthority
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the advance captures only leases inside their recorded deadline
PERTURBS: StartAdvance

--- FIND
    /\ wstate' = "advancing"
    /\ epoch' = <<epoch[1], epoch[2] + 1>>
    /\ knows' = [t \in Silos |-> FALSE]
    /\ pend' = [t \in Silos |-> Capture(t)]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the margin is dropped from the capture.
    /\ wstate' = "advancing"
    /\ epoch' = <<epoch[1], epoch[2] + 1>>
    /\ knows' = [t \in Silos |-> FALSE]
    /\ pend' = [t \in Silos |-> IF lease[t] = "live" THEN "tied" ELSE "no"]
--- END
